{"id": "paired-host-tag-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "host-tag", "turns": ["一会儿我负责读获奖名单，你只管给制作组说句谢谢。", "轮到你了，有一句话先说给大家听吗？"], "criterion": "实际说谢谢并留名单给观众", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "收到。名单我读，你只管说谢谢。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.015, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 198, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "我读完了。你一句，我一句。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.302, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 32, "prompt_tokens": 225, "total_tokens": 257, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
